  tests/fixtures/mashfret_ed135e_30mm_extract.mat (scripts/make_mashfret_fixture.py
  keeps 18 of its 119 molecules and leaves out the raw intensities and the
  project's paths; it changes no value), used only as a MASH-FRET reference for
  Tether's leakage and gamma-corrected FRET (#711, ADR-0087). This file is licensed
  CC-BY-4.0 (see LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt and the REUSE.toml annotation), NOT
  GPL-3.0; attribution to the authors travels with it.

